              "text": "`pd.read_csv()` is the main pandas function for reading a delimited text file — such as a CSV — into a DataFrame. `pd.read_excel()` reads an Excel file (such as a .xlsx workbook) into a DataFrame. Use `read_csv` for `orders.csv`; use `read_excel` for `orders.xlsx`.",
